    "governance_anchor_low_usd": 11988,
    "governance_anchor_high_usd": 12000,
    "business_tier_vs_governance_anchor_pct": 50.0,
    "finding": "Two separate budget lines, and mem20 is mispriced against both. (1) MEMORY API: the highest published price point is $4,500 (Zep Flex Plus); mem20's entry tier is $6,000, i.e. +33% versus that ceiling, and 100% of published memory-API points sit at or below it. mem20 has no land tier - every buyer enters at 1.3x the category's top published price. (2) GOVERNANCE: the audit/control budget line transacts at $11,988-$12,000 (Lyzr platform top tier, S29). mem20's Business tier at $18,000 is +50% versus that anchor, so the governance capability is priced correctly at Business - and is given away inside Team, which is the leak quantified in margin_leak."
  },
